    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Define Your Schema & Card Fields\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Decide which fields your dashboard will use and how one item’s data could appear.\r\n\r\nUse your selected dataset and project plan to complete the `Data Schema`, `Card View`, and `Filter Clarity Notes` sections. Leave the `App View` section blank for now.\r\n\r\n1. In the `Data Schema` section, list the fields you want to keep. Include each field’s data type and how it might be used, such as display, filter, sort, or transparency.\r\n2. In the `Card View` section, sketch how one item from your dataset could appear as a card. Show where the fields from your schema could appear.\r\n3. In the `Filter Clarity Notes` section, identify any fields you plan to use as filters and explain how they will help users find or understand the data.\r\n4. Add your completed SketchLab work to your Backpack.",
